  "body": "Per the discussion in #6763 I had a look at https://www.w3.org/TR/css-paint-api-1/#2d-rendering-context which has\r\n\r\n> `PaintRenderingContext2D includes CanvasFillStrokeStyles;`\r\n\r\nHowever, `CanvasGradient` and `CanvasPattern` aren't exposed in `PaintWorklet` which is a bit weird. There might be more issues along these lines.",
